url: 'https://ce-rise-models.codeberg.page/dp-record-metadata/'
abstract: >-
  This model provides a universal metadata envelope that declares which data models and schemas compose a DMP/DPP record, regardless of their origin. The metadata acts as a "table of contents" that tells consumers which models to use for interpreting each part of the composite DMP/DPP record, promoting an open and extensible ecosystem rather than a closed system.
